name: sim.getStringProperty
description: Fetches a string property (text)
luaSynopsis: string propertyState = sim.getStringProperty(int target, string propertyName, dict options = {})
pythonSynopsis: string propertyState = sim.getStringProperty(int target, string propertyName, map options = {})
inputs:
1. target: target item
2. propertyName: property name
3. options: an optional map. Set options.noError to true for silent errors
outputs:
1. propertyState: property value
